WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:01.560
Bring him in

00:01.640 --> 00:03.040
Yes

00:17.880 --> 00:19.080
A nobody

00:19.160 --> 00:20.560
Not worth mentioning

00:25.080 --> 00:26.680
You're actually Prince of Jin

00:27.800 --> 00:29.200
What?

00:29.760 --> 00:31.760
Regret not killing me back then?

00:36.120 --> 00:38.240
Your Highness has the bearing of dragon and phoenix

00:38.320 --> 00:40.120
I actually didn't see it

00:41.080 --> 00:42.680
My eyes are blind

00:43.120 --> 00:44.520
Not undeserved
